{
  "key": "common-app-core",
  "portal": "COMMON_APP",
  "version": 11,
  "_note": "v11: radios verified LIVE against logged-in apply.commonapp.org. Legal sex (3/14) and citizenship status (3/17) now use exact stable #option_ques_* ids via radio-map (previous #radioGroup* selectors were invented and never resolved). Self-report (2/2) upgraded to exact ids. Text fields use #text_ques_* ids; activity checkbox groups use within:#text_ques anchors matched by label. Built from real captures of apply.commonapp.org. Stable selectors only: #text_ques_NNN ids, label:, and structural strategies (nth:, within:) — never Angular auto-indexed names (mat-radio-group-N / ca-checkboxList-N change every render). Activity checkbox groups are anchored to the stable hours input of each activity card (#text_ques_{936+9i}) via within:. Text-like fields that are really combobox widgets are committed by the engine via overlay option click (smartFillText).",
